{"hw":"ἀντιγραφεύς","html":"<div class=\"lex-entry\"><h4 class=\"lex-hw gk\">ἀντιγραφεύς</h4><span class=\"lex-orth gk\">ἀντιγραφ-εύς</span>, <span class=\"lex-itype gk\">έως</span>, <span class=\"lex-gram\">ὁ</span>, <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"1\"><span class=\"lex-n\">A</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">checking-</b> or <b class=\"lex-tr\">copying-clerk,</b> a public officer, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Aeschin.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">3.25</span> </span>. cf. <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">IG</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">2.408</span> </span>, al., cf. <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">575</span> </span> (of a deme), <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">SIG</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">364.22</span> </span> (Ephesus), etc., <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Plb.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">6.56.13</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">PRev.Laws</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">12.1</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">ἀ. τῶν εἰσενεγκόντων</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">one who keeps a check upon</b> their <b class=\"lex-tr\">accounts,</b> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">D.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">22.70</span> </span>.</div></div>"}